Description: word-sys PDF Editor - Modern GTK4/Libadwaita PDF Editor
 word-sys PDF Editor allows users to open PDF files, view pages with
 hardware-accelerated continuous scrolling, edit existing text blocks,
 fill and build interactive AcroForm fields, apply cryptographic redactions,
 perform Optical Character Recognition (OCR) on scanned documents, and add
 annotations, stamps, sticky notes, and geometric measurements.
 It exports to DOCX, PPTX, ODT, ODP, and TXT formats using the pure-Python
 anyconvert engine and supports PAdES digital signatures, RFC 3161 timestamps,
 and PKCS#11 hardware tokens.
